Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:32.05,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,In this world, there are many unseen Pokémon \N which have only been spoken of in folklore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.80,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,This book contains the author's depictions \N of many such Pokémon. {Should "depiction" be singular or plural? - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.81,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Is that the one you're searching for, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:47.44,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Yes. Papa has been searching for it a long time. \N The mysterious Pokémon, Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.73,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:50.78,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:54.28,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,The phantom Pokémon, Entei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.03,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Your favourite, Mī...{Since I hate practically every conceivable way this character's name could possibly be spelled in one way or another... this is about the only thing I could think of that didn't make me want to pull my hair out in frustration. "Me" is the official spelling but it opens the floodgates to untold amounts of unintentionally stupid lines, "Mii" makes me think of a Nintendo product, and "Mi" was already used for the Sailor Moon-voiced captain in the last movie. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:01:01.58,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Entei is strong and kind. \N Just like you, Papa. {Suggesting that either this line be split into two sentences ("Entei is strong and kind. Just like you, Papa.") or the first comma be omitted, depending on what you deem most appropriate according to the delivery (unless you deem the line as it is the most grammatically appropriate, ofc) - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.71,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Papa's like Entei, huh? I hope I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.96,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,That settles it! Papa is Entei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.21,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It's Entei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.05,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,All right, we're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.15,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:36.99,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It must be yours, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.70,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I think it's important.{"isogi no meeru"... Tempted to put down "an urgent mail", but that would probably be a bit too eloquent for a kid who is, at the very least, younger than ten. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:47.00,Main,John,0,0,0,,It's John.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.42,Main,John,0,0,0,,Sir, we've found clues relating to \N Unknown in the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:52.55,Main,John,0,0,0,,Please come as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:54.46,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Clues relating to Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:56.09,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It really {\i1}was{\i0} about work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.09,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.98,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,I'll be back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.52,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:18.24,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Good night, Mī...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.35,Main,John,0,0,0,,It's here, Professor Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:48.19,Main,John,0,0,0,,We've never seen these letters before, \N but we believe the text is about the Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:50.56,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.98,Main,John,0,0,0,,You're the only one \N who can decipher it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:19.88,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.02,Main,Sully,0,0,0,,Unknown...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.20,Main,John,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.07,Main,John,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.37,Main,John,0,0,0,,Professor Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:48.17,Main,John,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:07.16,Main,David,0,0,0,,The young miss is truly alone now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:11.19,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa, are you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.15,Main,John,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:14.52,Main,David,0,0,0,,Young Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:31.41,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:33.29,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Please mail me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:38.42,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.72,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.72,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Are these for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.82,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I'm so lonely, Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:50.70,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Unknown...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.04,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Would you like to play with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:26.03,Main,John,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:32.49,Main,David,0,0,0,,Young Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:34.00,Main,John,0,0,0,,Those are Unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:36.00,Main,David,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.80,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:07:00.31,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa... come back to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:30.64,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Were you the one who called me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.27,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Entei?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:42.11,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I am... Entei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.90,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa... You're Papa, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.99,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You became an Entei and \N came back to me! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.28,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.87,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I am Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.42,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I shall grant your wish.{This actually came pre-commented, with the subtitles initially reading "If that is your wish", and saying that sounds better than the literal translation, but... see, he says that about a thousand times throughout the movie. It seems more to me like he just decides here that "Okay, my purpose in life is to give you whatever you want" and then throughout the rest of the movie he's all "Okay, so THAT'S what you want. Fine, then I shall give it to you!" -Starfish}{Xemnas: Also "If that is your wish" has a somewhat exasperated connotation to it, like I don't really want to but I'll do it anyway. -Xemnas}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:14.16,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Having traveled far \N from his hometown, Masara Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:17.16,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Satoshi aims to enter the \N Johto League with his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:20.25,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Their training journey \N continues today.{"shugyou no tabi"... I really don't want to put down "Journey of training" here... -Starfish}{Xemnas: Agreed}{Kinda wanna suggest "training journey" if you didn't already veto it the first time around. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.55,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,You're a Pokémon Trainer, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.05,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm Satoshi from Masara Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to become a Pokémon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.93,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,I'm Takeshi, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:36.89,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:38.01,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,My name's Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.60,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Well? Want to battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.68,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,How about it? \N What are you gonna do, Satoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:46.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It's common courtesy to \N accept a call to battle, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.02,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.28,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Let's give it our all as trainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Okay! {I know this kind of leads into the song, but for all the dialogue instances I've made it "Okay." -T}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:55.00,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let's battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.92,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,You guys are pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.80,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,We need to do more training!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:44.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Nah, we were really struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.43,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,That was your fifth battle this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:48.14,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Your Pokémon must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:49.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:53.14,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Lynn, do you happen to know if \N there's a Pokémon Center nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.81,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,There's one in Greenfield, \N just past this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.44,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,"Greenfield"? You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:02.32,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,The location named as the number one place \N for girls to visit in the Johto Region?! {Should region be capitalized? -T}{Might be too much, but suggesting: "The place known as the number one destination for girls/girls' destination in the Johto Region?!" Suggestion also applies for line 96. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.16,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.41,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,I'm headed there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:12.33,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Greenfield...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.46,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,A lush, peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:18.71,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,They say the wind that blows through it \N can calm the hearts of both people and Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:20.76,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.51,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,The number one place for girls to visit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.76,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,So many ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:35.27,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Greenfield's just past that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:57.42,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I am so glad we've been \N chasing Pikachu! {Is this Musashi line supposed to be verbose? - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:02.76,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We finally reached the place of my dreams, Greenfield, but... What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.34,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Green? More like light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.55,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.93,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Did somebody use Pay Day, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.65,Main,Sonansu,0,0,0,,Sonansu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.65,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur3\pos(640,638)}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.69,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,You came out on your own {\i1}again{\i0}?!{Oh right... Back when this movie came out SOOOOONANSU was still a recent enough addition to the cast that his constant popping out to agree with stuff was worth commenting on. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:16.35,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Get back inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.45,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Miss Junsa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.04,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.08,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:39.71,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:40.09,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.04,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.13,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:42.75,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:48.55,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Here we are in Greenfield, a peaceful town \N renowned for its lush, green scenery...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:52.81,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,...where an unprecedented phenomenon, \N which must be seen to be believed, has occurred. {Suggesting "...where an unprecedented phenomenon, which must be seen to be believed, has occured." - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:57.29,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,We believe this phenomenon \N originates from Sully Snowdon's mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:59.73,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,but we do not yet know any details.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.57,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Sully Snowdon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:23.96,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Professor Sully is well known throughout the world \N for his research on Legendary Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:27.30,Main,Kenji,0,0,0,,Wasn't Professor Sully \N one of your students, Professor Okido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.38,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Indeed, and a splendid one to boot! {WELCOME TO LIBERAL CITY -T}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:34.26,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I was sent \N a mail containing his latest thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:35.72,Main,Kenji,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.81,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,It's Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:38.80,Main,Kenji,0,0,0,,Unknown?{Yeah, he doesn't know. Stop asking.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.15,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Professor Okido, \N did you see what was on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.86,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I just watched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.03,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I'm about to head over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.28,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I'm going, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:52.78,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,You knew Sully as well, didn't you? {intentionally kept "mama-san" out of the line because it's a pain to translate and I can avoid it with just 'you'}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:56.12,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,His daughter is still young, so I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.37,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Understood. We'll leave posthaste!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:16:58.96,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.19,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Arriving here now \N at the Greenfield Pokémon Center...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.83,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,...are a group ready to \N take hold of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:40.37,Main,John,0,0,0,,Professor Okido, \N we've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:40.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:46.17,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Oh, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:49.01,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.47,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,What's this? You kids are here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:53.76,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Professor Okido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.55,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,I figured you'd make it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.43,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Have you been doing well, Satoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. How about you? {Split this line into two sentences. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.70,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:17.24,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I want a Mama, too...{A more exact phrasing would be "I also want a Mama", but awkward phrasing. She says it like "I want a mother just like that boy has", not "I want a mother as well as a father". -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:22.75,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If that's what you wish, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:28.21,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Long ago, Professor Sully was \N studying under Professor Okido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:31.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Didn't you say he used to help \N you with your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.01,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:36.22,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,He's visited Masara Town \N a few times since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I see, so that was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:41.93,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,That's Professor Sully's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.52,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I'm really worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:44.56,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:08.13,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:11.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:12.72,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,A Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.01,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:17.05,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.43,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mama... You are... Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.81,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}You are Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.69,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I am... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:31.19,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I am... Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:40.95,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:53.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom! Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:00.56,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.27,0:20:07.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:15.45,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Stay back, Satoshi! \N You don't know what's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:21.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Why? Why my mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.65,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I've brought her to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.88,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,The one you wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.22,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:43.47,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:51.90,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I am... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:56.57,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm here! It's Mī. {I can see why the spelling of her name was such an issue now. Went a bit liberal with this to avoid double "Me/Mi" -T}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.66,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:07.83,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:16.84,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Now I can be with Papa and Mama forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.09,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:19.88,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If that is what you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:51.59,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Your world continues to expand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.38,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:59.26,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If you are happy, then so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:14.86,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,The Pokémon who \N kidnapped Satoshi's mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:16.94,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,It was Entei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:17.98,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Entei?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:20.86,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,It's only been spoken of in legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:25.37,Main,John,0,0,0,,There's another mysterious Pokémon \N involved in this case, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.37,0:22:26.70,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Unknown, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:29.70,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,The one you've been researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:32.75,Main,John,0,0,0,,The Unknown are inside that mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:34.75,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:36.04,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.85,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Right now at Greenfield, \N the site of the mysterious sprawling crystal formation, {Suggesting "sprawling" in case of "spreading". - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:56.65,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,we're told that the Pokémon who \N kidnapped the female bystander is known as Entei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:59.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mom! Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:59.19,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,However, details of the event \N are currently unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.41,0:23:11.91,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,A bulldozer has just arrived \N to clear through the crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:31.02,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:32.64,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Don't destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:02.65,Main,John,0,0,0,,Professor Sully's disappearance, \N this mysterious crystallization,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:04.88,Main,John,0,0,0,,and even the sudden arrival of Entei...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.88,0:24:07.59,Main,John,0,0,0,,All of it was caused by the Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:09.76,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I can't imagine any other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.31,0:24:12.48,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.23,0:24:16.73,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa and Mama came back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:18.48,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I'm happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:19.65,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Everything is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:21.98,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,So stay out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.82,0:24:24.32,Main,John,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:27.82,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Her sending me this mail \N must mean she's all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:31.45,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,But this is strange. \N Isn't her dad missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.45,0:24:32.12,Main,John,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:34.04,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,And when she said "Mama"...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:34.96,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Puzzling, to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:52.89,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa, your back is so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.89,0:24:53.97,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.97,0:24:54.64,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.81,0:25:03.61,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I can't wait around for them \N to solve the puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.61,0:25:05.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You gonna come with me, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.74,0:25:09.99,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Wait, Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:13.58,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,I'm going, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:14.79,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Don't leave me behind, either! {Fixed Takeshi's speaker tag. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:17.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Kasumi, Takeshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:26.22,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.67,0:25:29.18,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Satoshi, take that Pokégear with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:30.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lynn...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.26,0:25:33.01,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Probably best to have a way of \N communicating with the Pokémon Center, right?{Xemnas: This sounds a little more natural}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.01,0:25:36.48,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,I'll think of an excuse \N to tell Professor Okido. {Might be too liberal/non-specific, but suggesting "something" in place of "an excuse". - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.69,0:25:38.69,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:47.00,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Water doesn't seem to crystallize...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:52.24,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. If we follow the river, we should be able to \N find a way inside the Snowdon mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.83,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Those guys never give up, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:02.54,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We are Team Rocket, \N aiming for outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:04.96,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,If going from below won't work, \N we'll drop in from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:08.80,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Our goal: to take the castle's treasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.80,0:26:11.60,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a great feeling!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.60,0:26:16.64,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:19.31,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Isn't that the thing they were \N talking about on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.31,0:26:21.05,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Entei, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.74,0:26:28.82,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}What an awful feel{\fscx250}-{\r\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.34,0:26:38.10,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,How cruel can you be to attack us \N out of nowhere like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:40.37,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,At least we got ourselves inside, meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.37,0:26:42.03,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,But what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.03,0:26:44.53,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like there's any treasure here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.53,0:26:48.80,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Besides, any treasure worth having \N should be carried on you at all times!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.80,0:26:51.38,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Does that mean the treasure's \N in that tower, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.38,0:26:53.39,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,If we want to go to that tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.01,0:26:57.31,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We'll have to go down, then back up...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:26:59.64,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Easier said than done...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.64,0:27:01.06,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Do they not have an elevator?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.06,0:27:02.60,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Of course not, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:10.24,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.24,0:27:13.07,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Nobody. We're the only ones here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.83,0:27:19.58,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama, they're showing our house! \N Isn't it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.42,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.71,0:27:28.22,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Something resembling a flame was just spotted \N above the Snowdon mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.22,0:27:29.88,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,but we cannot confirm at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:33.64,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,A rescue squad is set to arrive \N tomorrow morning, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.64,0:27:36.14,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Hm? Are those... Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.85,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right, Fushigidane, Chicorita! \N Use Vine Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.85,0:27:47.32,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Togepi, keep still for a bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.42,0:28:05.63,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Satoshi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.63,0:28:08.00,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,What is he {\i1}doing{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.00,0:28:10.26,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Um, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:18.05,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It looks like someone is trying \N to get into our house...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.61,0:28:26.94,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Satoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.86,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,How could you even think of doing \N something so dangerous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.20,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,What is it, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.24,0:28:37.78,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:39.83,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,The thing on his back is a Pikachu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.79,0:28:46.00,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Ah! He has a Fushigidane \N and a Chicorita, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:49.84,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama, is he a Pokémon Trainer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.84,0:28:50.80,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.80,0:28:53.80,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Maybe he has other Pokémon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.80,0:28:54.67,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Right, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.38,0:28:56.47,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.22,0:29:04.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.69,0:29:09.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,And thanks to you, too, Fushigidane and Chicorita. \N You really came through for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:37.22,Main,Lynn,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.22,0:29:38.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lynn?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.11,0:29:40.68,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Satoshi, you were just on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:44.60,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Professor Okido.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.60,0:29:45.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:50.56,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I won't order you back after already making it there! \N Just save your mother and hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.56,0:29:51.48,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:53.03,Main,John,0,0,0,,Satoshi, it's John.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.03,0:29:54.53,Main,John,0,0,0,,Have you seen any Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.90,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.90,0:29:57.36,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.36,0:29:59.99,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,According to Professor Sully's research,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:04.45,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Unknown can sense the feelings of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:05.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.33,0:30:09.34,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,They can sense the feelings in people's hearts \N and form reality from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.34,0:30:11.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,They can sense the feelings \N in our hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:15.34,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I believe the Unknown are reacting \N to the feelings in Mī's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.34,0:30:20.26,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,I'm certain the crystal tower was formed by \N the Unknown reacting to her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.64,0:30:29.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hinoarashi, Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.32,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:40.24,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.24,0:30:41.24,Main,Satoshi & Takeshi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Flamethrower!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.58,0:30:46.75,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Good job, Rokon!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.75,0:30:48.25,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right, let's swap battlers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.92,0:30:51.94,Main,Satoshi & Kasumi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Water Gun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.13,0:30:58.71,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right. Now, Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.14,0:31:09.31,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.19,0:31:21.57,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Hitodeman, good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:23.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You too, Waninoko. Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.84,0:31:43.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:48.22,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Is this what Professor Okido warned us about? \N The power of the Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:49.39,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.39,0:31:51.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Either way, we gotta keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.26,0:32:09.50,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:13.10,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,It's the world that \N the Unknown created from Mī's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:14.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.29,0:32:19.21,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Ouch! Oww!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.72,0:32:27.68,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,We finally reach the bottom, \N and what do we find?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.39,0:32:30.68,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Are these Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.68,0:32:33.56,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Best to steer clear of things \N we don't understand, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:37.69,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but we have to get through here \N to reach the other tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.69,0:32:40.19,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to sneak by!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.19,0:32:41.49,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.49,0:32:42.28,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Quiet steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.28,0:32:43.28,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Stealthy steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:44.11,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Soft steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.11,0:32:44.82,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Quiet steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:46.20,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Stealthy steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.78,0:32:52.16,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Looks like that boy from earlier and his friends \N got inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.16,0:32:53.41,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Should I remove them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:58.07,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I want to face them in a Pokémon battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.34,0:33:00.92,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,But do you think I can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.36,0:33:03.01,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.01,0:33:04.47,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If that is what you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.47,0:33:07.85,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,That's right! I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.85,0:33:10.39,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I'm still little, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.39,0:33:12.45,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,When I grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.45,0:33:13.98,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I can do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.12,0:33:38.58,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,This will be my first Pokémon battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.58,0:33:40.34,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,You can do it, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.59,0:33:46.84,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I can do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.56,0:33:52.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Entei?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.14,0:33:56.52,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,The three of you are \N Pokémon Trainers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.81,0:33:58.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.24,0:34:05.74,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Would you like to battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.74,0:34:09.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, \N but we don't have time for that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.45,0:34:11.16,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.16,0:34:12.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You, Entei over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:14.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Where did you take my mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.04,0:34:18.58,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Only my parents and I are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:19.46,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.46,0:34:20.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:22.38,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Satoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.38,0:34:24.42,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Your name is Mī, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:27.51,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Oh, you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.34,0:34:32.48,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Mī's much smaller than \N that though, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:36.56,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,This is Mī's world, as created by \N the power of the Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.56,0:34:40.48,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,That girl can make and become \N {\i1}anything{\i0} she wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.90,0:34:42.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.02,0:34:43.93,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Are we going to battle or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.73,0:34:45.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.82,0:34:49.36,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,I'll be your opponent, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:50.53,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.98,0:34:52.28,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Takeshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.28,0:34:54.08,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Entei came from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:56.54,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Your mom should be up there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.54,0:34:58.21,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Satoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.21,0:34:59.77,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Finding your mom's our first priority!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.63,0:35:02.69,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.59,0:35:07.59,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,We'll use three Pokémon each.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.59,0:35:09.34,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,You're free to switch out \N at any time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:10.89,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.82,0:35:28.68,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Go, Zubat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:38.96,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:40.25,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mokoko, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.21,0:35:48.04,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Zubat, use Supersonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.39,0:35:55.76,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.76,0:35:57.89,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Zubat, Wing Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:01.10,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Here it comes! Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:05.32,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Good job! Here it comes again! \N Use Headbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.82,0:36:08.40,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Now! Thunder Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.53,0:36:13.46,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Return, Zubat!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.49,0:36:18.70,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,You did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.08,0:36:22.50,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,We did it! \N That was amazing, Mokoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:25.00,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,This match has only just begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.00,0:36:26.25,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Go, Rokon!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.80,0:36:32.38,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:34.22,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.77,0:36:42.69,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,A Himeguma, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.69,0:36:45.40,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,A cute Pokémon for a cute lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.80,0:36:47.90,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It isn't just cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:49.36,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Himeguma, Explosive Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.95,0:36:56.87,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Rokon, use Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.62,0:36:59.20,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Himeguma, Fury Swipes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.09,0:37:11.84,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,These pokémon were created \N from Mī's heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.84,0:37:14.09,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,They're a lot stronger than they look!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:18.60,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,Soft steps, quiet steps, \N stealthy steps...{Very much a preference thing, but suggesting that this line be extended for the duration of it being repeated. Ignore if it's against policy (I don't recall if you vetoed it when I suggested it for an episode of the BD batch). - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.06,0:37:22.02,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Is there really any treasure here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.02,0:37:26.44,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,What are you blabbering about? \N We can't go back empty-handed after all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.57,0:37:31.74,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Return, Rokon!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.64,0:37:37.03,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,You're pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.03,0:37:38.33,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.33,0:37:42.87,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but I'm training to become \N the world's greatest Pokémon Breeder!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:51.67,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Both trainers and Pokémon need \N to be properly raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.05,0:37:54.05,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Need to be properly raised...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.05,0:37:54.93,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.84,0:37:57.64,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.64,0:37:59.05,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,That's a nice smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.35,0:38:01.31,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You're a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:07.23,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Gomazo, use Rollout!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.24,0:38:21.45,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take us lightly \N just because we're small!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.65,0:38:56.45,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Mī, is this your picture book?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.45,0:38:57.74,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.74,0:39:00.74,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa used to read it to me \N all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.74,0:39:01.70,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:05.12,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You can have it if you want, Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.58,0:39:12.04,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Mī, have you always been alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.00,0:39:14.46,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Did you start feeling lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.46,0:39:17.22,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,A little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.55,0:39:23.47,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,But it's okay now...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.47,0:39:25.65,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama and Papa are here...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:04.18,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,So which of you will battle me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.64,0:40:06.05,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,That must mean Takeshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.56,0:40:12.65,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī cannot possibly lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.11,0:40:15.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Is Entei an illusion, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.86,0:40:19.11,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,I want to battle a stronger trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.11,0:40:20.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.11,0:40:23.07,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Satoshi, leave her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.07,0:40:24.28,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.28,0:40:26.49,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,I'm the world's greatest beauty, Kasumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.49,0:40:30.46,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,In a fair world, I would have been \N the leader of Hanada Gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.46,0:40:32.17,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You're a Gym Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:34.63,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Don't look down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.63,0:40:37.88,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You don't have to be an adult \N to be a Gym Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.88,0:40:41.01,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,You can be whatever you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.06,0:40:57.48,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Her real body is probably with your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.48,0:40:59.14,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Hurry up to where she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.32,0:41:05.24,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,I'm from Hanada Gym, \N so I'll be using Water types!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.24,0:41:08.12,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Then I'll use Water-type Pokémon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.98,0:41:32.42,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.42,0:41:34.77,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,You can do anything here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.77,0:41:35.94,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Let's battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:39.61,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.61,0:41:41.65,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Kingdra, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.28,0:41:47.41,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Go, my steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.96,0:41:56.46,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,All right! \N Now go for a Headbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.76,0:42:03.05,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Tosakinto, Fury Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.23,0:42:17.61,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Tosakinto, you did your best...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.61,0:42:19.19,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.53,0:42:24.15,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,This one's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.53,0:42:27.78,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.78,0:42:29.58,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,How is this even {\i1}possible{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.58,0:42:32.95,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Don't waste time \N with common sense! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.95,0:42:35.71,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We are Team Rocket, \N aiming for outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.71,0:42:37.85,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Just keep aiming higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.85,0:42:39.63,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Or something to that effect, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.60,0:42:49.60,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.14,0:42:57.10,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mantine, now use Whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.36,0:43:04.74,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:06.11,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Bubble Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.95,0:43:12.45,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Hitodeman, Rapid Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.42,0:43:22.75,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.75,0:43:24.17,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.80,0:43:27.68,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mantine, Take Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:29.14,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Hitodeman, Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.02,0:43:40.86,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.86,0:43:42.82,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:47.11,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Nothing makes me happier \N than seeing you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.11,0:43:49.53,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Thank you, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.22,0:44:11.51,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Satoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.51,0:44:13.31,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.31,0:44:14.89,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.89,0:44:19.31,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,But I can't believe you came all the way here... \N You're still as reckless as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.31,0:44:20.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It's because I'm your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.86,0:44:24.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mī?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.02,0:44:25.23,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.23,0:44:26.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What about Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.99,0:44:28.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,...Not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.45,0:44:31.99,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,If you mean the Pokémon that brought me here, \N he left a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.74,0:44:34.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That was Entei.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.03,0:44:35.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,This crystal tower and that Entei...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.87,0:44:40.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,...were both created by Pokémon called Unknown, \N who sensed what Mī wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.35,0:44:41.50,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.50,0:44:44.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.09,0:44:45.15,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.17,0:44:47.88,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.88,0:44:49.80,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.43,0:44:55.56,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.56,0:44:57.89,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Listen, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.48,0:45:05.40,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I'm not your real mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.65,0:45:10.17,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,I'm Satoshi's mother. Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.66,0:45:14.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Do you remember who I am, Mī?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.74,0:45:17.79,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We met in Masara Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.79,0:45:19.96,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Please, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.96,0:45:20.92,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.75,0:45:25.29,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,You can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.05,0:45:29.17,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.47,0:45:33.18,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.76,0:45:36.97,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:51.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom... Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.90,0:45:53.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.49,0:45:54.37,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.67,0:46:06.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.47,0:46:17.68,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,What is the matter, Mī?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.68,0:46:21.31,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa, that boy wants \N to take Mama away!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.19,0:46:25.19,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.19,0:46:27.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.15,0:46:29.68,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Leave her and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.68,0:46:32.28,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I could never do that! \N She's my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:37.24,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,She is Mī's mother here. {Suggesting that "she's" be de-contracted. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.24,0:46:38.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You can't just decide that!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.70,0:46:40.16,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.16,0:46:43.08,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If you refuse to leave on your own, \N I will {\i1}make {\i0}you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.08,0:46:44.75,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We'll see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Waninoko, I choose you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.42,0:46:55.30,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,You think you can defeat {\i1}me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.30,0:46:57.60,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I won't lose to an illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.60,0:46:59.97,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Waninoko, Water Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.18,0:47:05.56,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I'm an illusion, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.56,0:47:06.24,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.57,0:47:16.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Return, Waninoko!{Xemnas: I don't hear anything being said here}{For some reason you can't hear him in Aegisub, but played with MPC you can... I have no idea why, but it seems okay -T}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.60,0:47:20.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,If water won't work, \N let's try fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:22.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Go, Hinoarashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.79,0:47:29.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hinoarashi, Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.47,0:47:39.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Return, Hinoarashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.81,0:47:44.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He's strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.06,0:47:47.23,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Do you still believe me \N to be an illusion? {Is the implicit "to be" after "me" omittable? It reads bit weird to me, but leaving it to those who can English better than I. - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:51.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You're an illusion of Entei \N created by that girl's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.69,0:47:53.40,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.40,0:47:54.78,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:05.18,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I'm a mere illusion, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.22,0:48:19.05,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I am... I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.72,0:48:22.64,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,...this girl's father!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.85,0:48:26.90,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.69,0:48:35.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.50,0:48:51.75,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Mī, you need to remember... {Xemnas: a little change}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.75,0:48:54.34,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Remember your real \N Papa and Mama!{Xemnas: corrected for above line}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.59,0:48:57.72,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Mī!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.59,0:49:00.05,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.43,0:49:04.10,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.10,0:49:05.60,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,A battle, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.60,0:49:07.93,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,And we're caught in the middle...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.99,0:49:24.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.64,0:49:43.72,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.60,0:49:49.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.02,0:49:52.27,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:00.57,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.07,0:50:03.45,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:12.00,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:13.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,My friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:14.75,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.92,0:50:21.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,My Pokémon are all friends \N I've made on my journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.84,0:50:23.93,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Friends...?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.93,0:50:26.31,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I care not how many \N of them there are!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.77,0:50:38.19,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.19,0:50:40.11,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,...your friends too, aren't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:42.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Takeshi! Kasumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.36,0:50:45.74,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Before you even ask us \N about "this" or "that"...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.74,0:50:46.95,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Musashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.95,0:50:48.20,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Kojiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.20,0:50:50.04,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,And Nyarth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:52.62,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're your friends \N from Team Rocket!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.62,0:50:54.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Team Rocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.29,0:50:55.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Why are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.88,0:50:58.96,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.17,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.17,0:51:01.88,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Our hands happened to reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.88,0:51:04.54,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We may be enemies, \N but we got history together, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.23,0:51:17.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Come on, Mī. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.19,0:51:21.86,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,My friends are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.86,0:51:22.95,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.78,0:51:26.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.95,0:51:31.62,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.62,0:51:35.87,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Do you really think \N you can be Mī's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.87,0:51:39.93,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,As long as she wishes it, \N I {\i1}will{\i0} be Mī's father!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.89,0:51:55.06,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:14.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.17,0:52:22.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.14,0:52:30.93,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.64,0:53:17.73,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, Fire Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.74,0:53:35.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Entei, please! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.70,0:53:40.25,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,If you really care about Mī, \N then listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.13,0:53:52.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You can't stay here with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.09,0:53:53.47,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.26,0:53:59.52,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, \N I desire to grant Mī's wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.27,0:54:04.38,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.32,0:54:27.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,If you keep her here, \N she'll always be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.84,0:55:16.14,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.85,0:55:18.56,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.72,0:55:19.81,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.40,0:55:35.03,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa, stop... No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.03,0:55:36.53,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,No more of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.59,0:55:52.24,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Mī, I lost against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.13,0:55:56.51,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Your Gomazo's Rollout \N was really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.51,0:55:58.81,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Your Mantine's Whirlpool, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.81,0:56:02.43,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,You could be a Gym Leader one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.43,0:56:04.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,After a battle ends, {Is he saying in these three lines that the two battlers stay friends? Cause if so, suggesting "After a battle ends, us trainers who love Pokémon..." (No suggestions for "We stay good friends/pals/amigos/panas/tomodachi/nakama", I think it's good as-is). - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.02,0:56:06.98,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,us trainers \N who love Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:08.69,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We stay good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:15.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.11,0:56:18.24,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Even if you fight outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.24,0:56:19.45,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,You can make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.87,0:56:22.12,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.84,0:56:31.76,Main,Hanako,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.49,0:57:01.24,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,It's warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.22,0:57:24.31,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.31,0:57:29.73,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I was born to be a father \N with the sole desire to make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.19,0:57:34.57,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If your happiness \N lies in the outside world...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.57,0:57:36.12,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.91,0:57:45.62,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.62,0:57:46.46,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.46,0:57:47.66,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.02,0:58:11.10,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.78,0:58:18.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, take care of Mī!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:22.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.57,0:58:23.71,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Everybody, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.17,0:58:40.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.26,0:58:41.84,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,It's the Unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.84,0:58:45.97,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,They're no longer able to control \N the power they've unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.97,0:58:48.35,Main,John,0,0,0,,The crystallization is \N rapidly approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:51.44,Main,John,0,0,0,,Satoshi, you have to stop \N the Unknown from running wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.44,0:58:52.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Got it!{Oops, missing line. Well, it's fixed now yay -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.41,0:59:13.04,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,The crystallization is \N spreading further!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.04,0:59:17.55,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Even the Pokémon Center is \N being engulfed by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.55,0:59:18.71,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.71,0:59:19.21,Main,TV Reporter,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.21,0:59:19.84,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.86,0:59:36.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,These are the Unknown...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.65,0:59:38.42,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,How do we stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.62,0:59:47.08,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,There's a barrier protecting them!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.08,0:59:48.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lizardon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.26,1:00:00.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.44,1:00:14.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.77,1:00:16.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.47,1:00:50.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.25,1:01:15.00,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Isn't this, like, really bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.00,1:01:18.13,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like there's any treasure, either,  \N so let's just go home, meow!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.13,1:01:20.00,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:21.50,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Excuse us...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.38,1:01:26.80,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We're blocked in, meow!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.80,1:01:30.14,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Somebody {\i1}do{\i0} something!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.64,1:01:35.73,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Unknown, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.26,1:02:13.38,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.47,1:02:16.98,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,It brought me much happiness... {Suggesting "brought" instead of "gave". - Toa}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.98,1:02:19.48,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,...to have been your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.02,1:02:22.77,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,The last thing I can do for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.77,1:02:25.60,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,...is to take you from this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.44,1:02:27.65,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.65,1:02:31.24,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I was born of your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.24,1:02:35.87,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,If you believe in me, \N there is nothing I cannot do.{Copied this verbatim from the dub because the dub-line sounds COOL, dammit! (Also because it's a totally valid translation of what he says.) -Starfish}{No complaints here. -T}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.35,1:02:57.31,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.06,1:03:01.23,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī... Mī!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.19,1:03:07.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mī, you have to believe in Entei!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.11,1:03:09.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Believe your Entei can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.30,1:03:21.63,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,You can do it, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.34,1:03:24.59,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.78,1:03:50.36,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.23,1:04:22.31,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.35,1:04:24.31,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Mī!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.03,1:04:35.07,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.53,1:04:38.45,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling me Papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.83,1:04:43.65,Main,Entei,0,0,0,,I shall return to your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.89,1:05:01.52,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.65,1:06:38.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,This is the real...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.91,1:06:40.74,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Greenfield!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.74,1:06:42.33,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:52.63,Main,Okido,0,0,0,,Hey, are you youngsters safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.63,1:06:54.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Professor Okido!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.98,1:06:56.22,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lynn!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.22,1:06:58.60,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here I am! {Changed this one pretty drastically, but it feels weird that Takeshi would shout out "Here I am!" like he's special for some reason, lol -T}{I mean... Does it really though? We're talking about the guy whose first reaction whenever he sees an attractive woman is to basically propose to them. Is it really so unreasonable that he would single himself out in this instance? -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.19,1:07:11.36,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.19,1:07:19.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let's go meet them, Mī.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.11,1:07:20.99,Main,Kasumi,0,0,0,,Everyone was worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.99,1:07:21.99,Main,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.99,1:07:22.94,Main,Me Myself & I,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.58,1:07:28.65,Main,John,0,0,0,,Mī!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.68,1:07:32.00,Main,David,0,0,0,,Young Miss!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.84,1:07:38.97,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Well? What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.97,1:07:41.47,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,The ground's crawling with police officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.47,1:07:43.35,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Couldn't go down there if we wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.56,1:07:54.44,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,In any case...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.44,1:07:57.69,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,That's one less lonely girl, meow!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.69,1:07:59.82,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,But there's another in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.82,1:08:02.24,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,A young, lonely girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.24,1:08:03.91,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Musashi!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.91,1:08:06.70,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,And a young man taking a stand \N against loneliness...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.70,1:08:07.79,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Kojiro!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.79,1:08:10.32,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,The moon's always on its own, meow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.79,1:08:15.38,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Behold! The wind blows \N through Greenfield!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.38,1:08:17.71,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Even if you're alone, \N we'll be your friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.71,1:08:20.26,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somehow, this is a really...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.26,1:08:27.01,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\i1}...great feeling!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.29,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:09.80,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Let's move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:13.55,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Together, we'll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:17.43,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Though the wind may change...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:24.18,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! ...my dream is unchanging!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.61,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,We've been so focused on making it this far...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.53,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...that we didn't even notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:36.09,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...that we'd already obtained the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.09,0:10:41.87,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...to the door leading to the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.67,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,Golden Smile & Silver Tears
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.25,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,Delight and frustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:55.26,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...are always changing faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:59.39,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...and making everyone stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:05.02,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.81,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! My spirit will never falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:12.57,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Even if we crash into a wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:20.24,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! ...this journey won't end!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.77,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,It's not as though there haven't been times...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:27.62,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...where I felt ready to give it up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:31.59,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,But the me from the day I set off, burning with anticipation...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:37.22,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...asks "Are you really okay with that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:42.76,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,Golden Sun & Silver Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.85,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,The sun and moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:50.52,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...are always changing faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.61,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,...and watching over everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:58.28,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:02.20,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Swallow your fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:05.75,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Use your best move: "Bravado"! {からげんき is the Japanese name of the move Façade... But seeing how that move was only introduced in Gen 3 and this is obviously a Gen 2 movie, that is likely a coincidence, especially seeing how the NEXT "move" referenced in this song does not exist at all. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:09.33,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Though I don't know their names or voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:13.13,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,they're waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:17.21,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,I want to meet them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:53.53,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:57.42,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Let's open the next door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:13:01.18,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! Use your best move: "Recklessness"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.55,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK! My friends, with whom I've shared laughter and tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:08.35,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,are here by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.67,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,I believe in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.32,Song TL,OK! - English,0,0,0,,OK!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.29,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:09.80,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! tsugi ni susumou ze!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:13.55,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! issho nara daijoubu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:17.43,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! kaze ga kawatte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:24.18,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! kawaranai ano yume!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.61,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,koko made kuru no ni muchuu sugite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.53,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,kizukazu ni ita keredo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:36.09,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,atarashii sekai e no tobira no kagi wa
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.09,0:10:41.87,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,shiranai uchi ni get shite ita yo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.67,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,Golden Smile & Silver Tears
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.25,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,yorokobi to kuyashisa to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:55.26,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,kawari banko ni kao dashite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:59.39,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,minna o tsuyoku shite kureteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:05.02,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! ore ni tsuite koi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.81,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! kiai nara makenai ze!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:12.57,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! kabe ni butsukatte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:20.24,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! owaranai kono tabi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.77,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,akirame kaketari shita koto mo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:27.62,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,nakatta wake ja nai keredo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:31.59,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,tabidachi no ano asa no moeteru ore ga
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:37.22,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,sore de ii no ka to toi kakete kuru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:42.76,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,Golden Sun & Silver Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.85,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,ohisama to otsukisama
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:50.52,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,kawari banko ni kao dashite
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.61,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,minna o mimamotte kureteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:58.28,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,dakara
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:02.20,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! fuan nante tabechaou!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:05.75,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! jiman no waza "karagenki"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:09.33,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! namae mo koe mo shiranai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:13.13,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,aitsura ga matteru hazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:17.21,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,aitsura ni aitain da!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:53.53,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,iku ze
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:57.42,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! tsugi no tobira akeyou ze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:13:01.18,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! jiman no waza "mukoumizu"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.55,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK! issho ni naite waratta
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:08.35,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,nakama tachi ga tsuite iru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.67,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,nakama tachi o shinjiteru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.32,OPRomaji,OK! - Romaji,0,0,0,,OK!!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.44,1:09:22.41,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,ame wa yagate agaru mono
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.41,1:09:27.66,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kumo wa itsuka kireru mono
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.66,1:09:33.79,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kao o agete goran
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.79,1:09:38.63,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kimi o yobu koe kikoeru hazu
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.63,1:09:50.85,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,hikaru namida wa hohoemi no maebure dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.85,1:09:59.82,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,itsuka sono kanashimi ni dareka ga tsubasa o kureru deshou
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.86,1:10:07.66,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kaze ga hoho o nadete yuku
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.66,1:10:12.88,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,hizashi kimi ni furisosogu
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.33,1:10:19.47,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,egao o omoidashita ne
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.47,1:10:24.30,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,dareka no koe ni kotaetan da ne
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:36.65,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,chiisana hohoemi shiawase no maebure dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.65,1:10:46.66,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,itsuka sono yorokobi ni kimi ga tsutsumareru koto deshou
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:57.00,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,tsubasa moratta kanashimi satta kokoro ni
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.00,1:10:59.46,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,niji wa umareru
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.46,1:11:05.47,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,sabishisa iro kara nukumori iro e
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.47,1:11:13.77,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,sore wa kimochi no guradeeshon
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.77,1:11:33.66,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}atataka na kagayaki o itsu made mo
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.14,1:12:03.11,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,hontou ni hontou no hitoribocchi nante
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:14.58,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,doko ni mo inai to iu koto kimi wa mou shitteiru hazu dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.58,1:12:26.55,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,dareka no namida ni itsu no hi ka deatta naraba
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.55,1:12:29.45,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kondo wa sono kanashimi ni
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.45,1:12:36.73,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,kimi ga tsubasa o ataemashou
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.73,1:12:46.99,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,tsubasa moratta kanashimi satta kokoro ni
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.99,1:12:49.70,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,niji wa umareru
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.70,1:12:55.46,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,sabishisa iro kara nukumori iro e
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.46,1:13:04.01,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,sore wa kimochi no guradeeshon
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.01,1:13:24.69,EDRomaji,Niji ga Umareta Hi - Romaji,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}atataka na kagayaki o itsu made mo
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.44,1:09:22.41,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,Before long, the rain will stop falling
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.41,1:09:27.66,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,Someday, the clouds will disperse
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.66,1:09:33.79,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,Go on and look up,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.79,1:09:38.63,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,and you will hear a voice calling out to you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.63,1:09:50.85,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,Glimmering tears are a prelude to a smile,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.85,1:09:59.82,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,so someday, somebody will give wings to your sadness
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.86,1:10:07.66,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,The wind strokes your cheeks
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.66,1:10:12.88,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,The sunlight streams down on you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.33,1:10:19.47,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,You remember how to smile, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.47,1:10:24.30,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,You've replied to the voice of another, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:36.65,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,A small smile is a prelude to happiness,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.65,1:10:46.66,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,so someday, you will be enveloped in that joy
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:57.00,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,My heart has been given wings and cast sadness aside,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.00,1:10:59.46,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,bringing forth a rainbow
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.46,1:11:05.47,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,From the color of loneliness to the color of warmth...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.47,1:11:13.77,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,That is the gradation of feelings
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.77,1:11:33.66,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}May that warm glow never fade away...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.14,1:12:03.11,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,You should already know that true, utter loneliness...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:14.58,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,...does not exist anywhere in the world
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.58,1:12:26.55,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,If someday, you encounter the tears of another...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.55,1:12:29.45,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,When such a time comes,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.45,1:12:36.73,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,you should be the one to give wings to their sadness
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.73,1:12:46.99,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,My heart has been given wings and cast sadness aside,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.99,1:12:49.70,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,bringing forth a rainbow
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.70,1:12:55.46,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,From the color of loneliness to the color of warmth...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.46,1:13:04.01,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,That is the gradation of feelings
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.01,1:13:24.69,Song TL,Niji ga Umareta Hi - English,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}May that warm glow never fade away...
